pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>04 实现该方案的挑战</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>挑战二：BRAM 存储极其有限</strong></p>
  - elementId: left-card-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 560, 280]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$light"
  - elementId: left-card-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 120, 520, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>BRAM 参数</strong></p>
  - elementId: left-card-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 155, 520, 225]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>BRAM ring 深度 = <strong>1024</strong></p>
        <p>Compact record 宽度受硬件约束</p>
        <p>trace_compact_record_t = 396 bits</p>
        <p>debug probe payload = 716 bits</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">计数器：</p>
        <p>• sequence（连续性检查）</p>
        <p>• captured_count（实际记录数）</p>
        <p>• dropped_count（丢包数）</p>
        <p>• wrap_count（覆盖数）</p>
  - elementId: right-card-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 110, 580, 280]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$light"
  - elementId: right-card-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 120, 540, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>压缩与窗口限定</strong></p>
  - elementId: right-card-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 155, 540, 225]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>① <strong>压缩</strong>：</p>
        <p>trace_packet_t（完整）→ trace_compact_record_t（compact）</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">② <strong>窗口限定</strong>：</p>
        <p>begin/end marker 限定只记录感兴趣时间段</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">这意味着：</p>
        <p>• 不能无差别记录所有 retired instruction</p>
        <p>• 必须维护质量计数器</p>
        <p>• 不是 production streaming</p>
  - elementId: bottom-note-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 410, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FEF3C7"
  - elementId: bottom-note-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 420, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>设计约束</strong>：trace 逻辑是 sideband-only。full trace sink 必须 never backpressure CVA6；当带宽超过时，必须 drop trace records 并 emit/count EVT_DROP。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>19</p>
